From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 19:10:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add visual colour previews to hex code hashtags

- Implement HashtagColorPreview helper component
- Calculate luminance to support adaptive swatch styling
- Integrate preview swatch into HandledLink and HashtagBar
- Ensure hex code extraction matches expected formatting
- Add unit tests for colour detection and rendering

Rationale: Providing an immediate visual representation for hex-code hashtags enhances the user experience for design-focused discussions by removing the need to manually interpret colour values.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

